# UserStory node schema
# User stories authored by humans in markdown, extracted to CSV via sync tool
# CSV is derived from markdown via sync tool — do not edit directly
# id_field: id
# csv_file: user_stories.csv
# optional: bounded_context, approved_by, approval_date
id,title,markdown_path,bounded_context,epic_id,status,approved_by,approval_date
# id: Unique identifier (e.g., US-OD-042)
# title: Short human-readable name
# markdown_path: Relative path to the source markdown file in the consuming project
# bounded_context: FK to bounded_contexts.csv id (e.g., BC-001). Optional until BCs are defined.
# epic_id: FK to epics.csv id (e.g., EPIC-OD-001)
# status: draft|approved|implemented|verified|deprecated
# approved_by: Identity of reviewer who approved this story (empty for draft).
# approval_date: ISO-8601 date of approval (e.g., 2026-05-15). Empty for draft.
